713:     /// page fault handlers to allocate zeroed pages.
714:     Anonymous,
715:     /// Memory in a [`Vmo`].
716:     ///
717:     /// These pages are associated with regular files that are backed by the page cache. On-demand
718:     /// population is possible by enabling page fault handlers to allocate pages and read the page
719:     /// content from the disk.
